===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|كفار|sc=Arab|tr=kaffār||infidel}} or {{term|كافر|sc=Arab|tr=kāfir||unbeliever}}, both from {{term|كفر|sc=Arab|tr=káfara||to cover, to hide}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|South Africa|pejorative|offensive|ethnic slur}} A [[black]] person.
